    "descriptionZh": "chanfana 是给 Hono、itty-router 等路由框架用的 OpenAPI 3/3.1 schema 生成与请求校验工具，class 写法写 endpoint。",
    "takeawayZh": "用 class 写接口，自动出 OpenAPI 并校验请求",
    "noteZh": "首屏左边是大标题 chanfana 与一句 OpenAPI 3 and 3.1 schema generator and validator for Hono, itty-router and more!，配一个火锅插画，下面两枚按钮 Getting Started 与 Auto Endpoints；再往下铺开六张功能卡，三列两行，分别是 OpenAPI Schema Generation、Automatic Request Validation、Class-Based Endpoints、Auto CRUD Endpoints、TypeScript Type Inference、Router Adapters。顶部导航只有 Home / Docs / Examples 三项加 GitHub 与 X 图标，页脚写 Released under the MIT License、Copyright © 2024-present Cloudflare。",
